<title>USA: Lawton Bronson CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</title>
<headline>Lawton Bronson CSD, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $5 million of Lawton Bronson CSD, Iowa, school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.314 percent.</p>
</text>
